  "name": "SER 2027 poster: rabbits, wildcats, pond turtles and a free-flowing river",
  "description": "Code, figures and text for an A0 poster for the 12th SER World Conference on Ecological Restoration (Lisbon, 2027, Lands in Motion). One map combines a rabbit release screen inside the wildcat's land corridors, a pond turtle pool screen, the two UNESCO World Heritage areas and Natura 2000 sites of the Greater Côa Valley, Portugal, and the Portugal-Spain border. Every figure on the poster is computed from the Côa Valley Eco-Connectivity v6 data bundle. These are screening maps, not release sites.",
